                                "sense_id": "226f3227-2c34-3fd6-af6f-c29645e14271",
                                "text": "The tailȝeour was no thing weill sittin, He left the sadill."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "629dfa95-9ccf-40a8-b60f-979582da34fb",
                                "sense_id": "226f3227-2c34-3fd6-af6f-c29645e14271",
                                "text": "He micht counter Will on horss, For Sym wes bettir sittin Nor Will."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a731caff-c941-3a63-a676-33c456e7dda0",
                        "entry_id": "858cd795-3288-3b0b-a770-386ce34c8ce9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Settled; stationary; not easily stirred or moved."
                        ],
