                                "sense_id": "398a7ec6-4ffe-3d1b-9dc2-61a47cb4469f",
                                "text": "For though we your brethren, who heretofore by our vocation have sitten in the chair of Moses, and be ghostly captains as Moses and Joshua unto you; [...]"
